e où nature, praticité et qualité de vie ne font qu’un.\nFlorilla, l’équilibre parfait entre charme, confort et modernité.","addr":"30 RUE DE LA RÉPUBLIQUE","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjE4MDk4YmJhM2YxMDgzMjkzMzM5NmNmZTYzM2UxYmIwNTE2ODRjYTgiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJmNTYwMjE1ZDU0ZDY2MDMzM2Q1OWM4OTk3OTg3N2E2NSJ9?signature=9c278a439926633b323591a58b10bba5654e67c01bf0ceba9b3e7322240095af","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjlmZGRkZmNjM2E1NTIyZWYzYTA4OTRhM2M0ODZlY2NmYzNjY2M0MjIiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiIxZDE1ZDFiMTE2Y2UxMGQ5MzJiZmY4MmNhY2Y5ZGQ4YSJ9?signature=1e6e78e806d8fa7b984352505c55dd11c569e49a7bf2473356fc1920f3126e54","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjE1ZTUzMzRiYjk5MDE0N2I5NjYwNjJiOTgyMzJjMWZhMjc2YWNjYWYiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJhY2Q5NTkwYWE1MGQ4NWQwMTllNjU2M2QxMjJhMDBiYiJ9?signature=27b9913d838f8228e884d7361f5cfc98cb229c794dfbb6737615e76543a70d1a","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6Ijc3NjkxNzg2Y2VhM2U5YzNhMTNjOGI5N2FhZThkYjcwZTc0NGIxNjQiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJiMDFlOWM5OGM2ZDU2M2ZkMTBlNGM1MzNhYzU4ODBkNCJ9?signature=2d5d3ce935ce97ba1124bf6a8db547f4d62351c33447c0fc494825bcc71fad48"],"yt":[],"vr":[],"logo":"https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182NjY2ZGYzYzZlZTcxIiwiZWRpdHMiOnsicmVzaXplIjp7IndpZHRoIjo4NSwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo4NSwiZml0IjoiY292ZXIifX0sImZpbGVIYXNoIjoidXBsb2FkaW5nXzY2NjZkZjNjNmVlNmUifQ==?signature=66893444d9cf8ece53bef1f580f7b406ddddff19da3b9249c2488783520